{"seq":2,"slug":"tax-engine-address-sourcing-pipeline","title":"税务引擎计算管线：地址校验、管辖来源与舍入幂等","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-tax-withholding-seller-1099-reporting/withholding-calculation-collection/tax-engine-address-sourcing-pipeline","wordCount":2642,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"税务引擎计算管线-地址校验-管辖来源与舍入幂等\">税务引擎计算管线：地址校验、管辖来源与舍入幂等</h1><p>同一笔订单在美国会在 5 个不同的地址维度上被问到&quot;税落在哪里&quot;：买家账单地址、买家收货地址、卖家发货仓地址、平台注册地址、以及货物途经的转运点。2026 年的主流税务引擎（Avalara AvaTax、Vertex O Series、Stripe Tax）把这个问题拆成一条固定管线：<strong>地址规范化 → 管辖落点（jurisdiction assignment）→ 税率查找 → 税额计算 → 舍入 → 幂等固化</strong>。任何一步用了非确定性输入（调用时刻、机器时区、单精度浮点、缓存的旧边界），下游的申报和对账都会在同一订单上给出两个不同的数。本文拆解这条管线的实现契约。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-管线的六个阶段与两个不变量\">核心概念：管线的六个阶段与两个不变量</h2><p>管线本身是纯函数式的，只有&quot;边界数据版本&quot;和&quot;地址解析结果&quot;是外部状态：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[原始地址&lt;br/&gt;订单/卖家资料] --&gt; B[规范化&lt;br/&gt;CASS/DPV 校验]&#10;  B --&gt; C{可解析?}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D[降级: ZIP/邮编市&lt;br/&gt;或拒绝交易]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| E[管辖落点&lt;br/&gt;rooftop 坐标/多边形]&#10;  E --&gt; F[税率查找&lt;br/&gt;按 sourcing 规则]&#10;  F --&gt; G[税额计算&lt;br/&gt;十进制精确乘]&#10;  G --&gt; H[舍入&lt;br/&gt;行级或单据级]&#10;  H --&gt; I[幂等固化&lt;br/&gt;输入 hash + 边界版本]&#10;  D --&gt; I\">graph TD\n  A[原始地址&lt;br/&gt;订单/卖家资料] --&gt; B[规范化&lt;br/&gt;CASS/DPV 校验]\n  B --&gt; C{可解析?}\n  C --&gt;|否| D[降级: ZIP/邮编市&lt;br/&gt;或拒绝交易]\n  C --&gt;|是| E[管辖落点&lt;br/&gt;rooftop 坐标/多边形]\n  E --&gt; F[税率查找&lt;br/&gt;按 sourcing 规则]\n  F --&gt; G[税额计算&lt;br/&gt;十进制精确乘]\n  G --&gt; H[舍入&lt;br/&gt;行级或单据级]\n  H --&gt; I[幂等固化&lt;br/&gt;输入 hash + 边界版本]\n  D --&gt; I</pre><p>两个不变量贯穿始终：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>确定性（determinism）</strong>：给定相同的订单快照与相同的税务边界版本，管线输出必须逐字节相同。这意味着不能读系统时钟、不能读随机数、不能依赖浮点累加顺序。</li>\n<li><strong>幂等（idempotency）</strong>：同一订单被重算 N 次（补算、退款、对账回溯）必须得到同一税额。工程上通过 <code>hash(地址快照 + 税率版本 + 基数 + 舍入模式)</code> 作为计算键实现，而非用&quot;最近一次&quot;的缓存值。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>管辖落点与来源（sourcing）是两件事：落点回答&quot;这个地址在哪些税区内&quot;，来源回答&quot;该用哪个税区的税率&quot;——美国多数州是<strong>目的地来源（destination sourcing）</strong>，即按货物交付地，而非卖方所在地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"地址校验-cass-dpv-与-不可解析-的降级\">地址校验：CASS、DPV 与&quot;不可解析&quot;的降级</h2><p>税务引擎的地址层不是地理编码器，而是<strong>投递点解析器</strong>。美国的标准链是 USPS 的 CASS（Coding Accuracy Support System）认证 + DPV（Delivery Point Validation）确认地址存在到投递点（rooftop）粒度，输出带 ZIP+4 的规范化地址。ZIP+4 是税务管辖的天然键——一个 9 位 ZIP 通常只覆盖极少数税务辖区组合，而 5 位 ZIP 可能横跨数百个税率组合。</p>\n<p>地址校验的输出是一个<strong>分级可信度</strong>，而不是布尔值。工程上必须区分：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解析级别</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>税务处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Rooftop / DPV 确认</td>\n<td>精确到投递点</td>\n<td>直接用该点所在多边形查税率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ZIP+4 命中</td>\n<td>落点段唯一</td>\n<td>用该段的主辖区组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ZIP+5 缺失，仅 5 位 ZIP</td>\n<td>段内税率不唯一</td>\n<td>取最高税率（保守）或取段内多数辖区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>城市/州级</td>\n<td>只知到城市</td>\n<td>仅州税可确定，地方税降级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完全不可解析</td>\n<td>无 ZIP 或境外无格式</td>\n<td>拒绝结账或按最高税率预扣</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>&quot;ZIP 内税率不唯一&quot;的处理是实践中反复出错的点。多数引擎取<strong>段内最高综合税率</strong>作为兜底，因为低估导致的欠缴罚款落在平台/卖家，而高估的差额通常在结算时退给买家。Stripe Tax 在 2026 年的文档中同样把&quot;地址不完整时按最高税率计算&quot;作为默认，并把该假设写进计算的 <code>taxability_reason</code> 字段以便审计回溯。</p>\n<p>对境外地址，管线换成另一套格式契约：欧盟要求 ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 国家码 + 当地邮编格式（如英国 <code>SW1A 1AA</code>、德国 5 位数字），并对 IOSS 场景校验&quot;内在价值 ≤ €150&quot;的门槛（欧盟委员会 OSS 指南，2021-07-01 起）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"管辖来源-目的地-起始地与市场代扣的三角\">管辖来源：目的地、起始地与市场代扣的三角</h2><p>同一个地址，落在谁的申报义务里，取决于<strong>来源规则</strong>和<strong>卖方身份</strong>两条正交的轴。美国 45 个州 + 华盛顿特区采用目的地来源（destination），另有若干州对特定交易保留起始地（origin）规则；欧盟 B2C 货物默认在<strong>运输终止地</strong>征税（VAT 指令第 33 条），但低于 €10,000 的跨境销售可继续按供应商所在国征税（欧盟委员会 OSS 门槛页面，2026 现行）。</p>\n<p>市场代扣（marketplace facilitator）叠在这之上：当平台被认定为撮合方，税款的<strong>申报义务转移到平台</strong>，但&quot;按哪个地址查税率&quot;这一环没有改变——仍是买家的交付地。这意味着同一个税率查找服务要同时对两类消费者返回结果：卖家自营申报时它是参考值，平台代扣时它是权威值。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = B \\times r_{j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>该落点所属税区组合的合成税率</strong>，而非单一税率。美国一个地址的综合税率通常由州、县、市、特别区（如交通区、体育场馆区）四层叠加：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>state</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>county</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>city</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mtext>special</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_j = r_{\\text{state}} + r_{\\text{county}} + r_{\\text{city}} + \\sum_{k} r_{\\text{special},k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">state</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">county</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">city</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">special</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>科罗拉多州是这套分层最极端的例子：州内存在大量<strong>自治市（home-rule）<strong>用自行定义且自收的税基，与州收的地方税并存，导致同一地理点上的&quot;州收 + 自治&quot;两套地方税必须分别判定与分别申报。工程上这意味着落点解析必须保留</strong>多辖区列表</strong>，而不是压成单一税率——一旦压扁，事后无法拆分申报。</p>\n<h2 id=\"舍入-行级还是单据级-以及为什么它不是细节\">舍入：行级还是单据级，以及为什么它不是细节</h2><p>舍入是确定性最容易被破坏的一环。核心争议是<strong>在行级舍入再求和</strong>，还是<strong>先求和再对总额舍入</strong>——两者在多行订单上会产生 1–N 分的差额，而 N 行越多、差额累积越大。</p>\n<p>Streamlined Sales Tax（SST）会员州的规则是明确的：把应税售价乘以适用税率，<strong>保留到第三位小数，第三位 &gt; 4 就进位</strong>到分。这条规则对现金、信用卡、借记卡或其他支付方式<strong>一视同仁</strong>（SST《Penny Elimination》指引，2026）。但 SST 的这条页面<strong>并未</strong>规定必须在行级还是单据级舍入——该细节下放到各州指引，这正是&quot;同一批货在 A 州与 B 州算出差一分&quot;的制度来源。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>舍入模式</th>\n<th>计算方式</th>\n<th>典型适用</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>行级舍入（line-level）</td>\n<td>每行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_i \\times r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 各自舍入后求和</td>\n<td>多数引擎默认，逐行可审计</td>\n<td>行数多时与单据级差 N 分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单据级舍入（invoice-level）</td>\n<td>先 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum B_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 再乘税率后舍入</td>\n<td>部分州/部分 ERP</td>\n<td>行级税额不可独立复算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>税组舍入</td>\n<td>按税率分组合并后舍入</td>\n<td>混合税率订单</td>\n<td>分组逻辑本身是设计决策</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实现上有一条硬约束：<strong>绝不能用 IEEE 754 双精度直接算钱</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.1 + 0.2 \\ne 0.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span></span></span></span></span> 的经典问题在税额上会表现为&quot;逐行累加与总额相差一分&quot;。正确做法是用十进制类型（Java <code>BigDecimal</code>、Python <code>decimal.Decimal</code>、Rust <code>rust_decimal</code>）或<strong>整数分</strong>运算，并在乘法后按显式 <code>RoundingMode.HALF_UP</code> 处理第三位小数。</p>\n<p>现金支付的<strong>五分钱舍入</strong>是另一层，且 SST 明确它<strong>不改变税额本身</strong>：税额仍按分计算并记录，只是&quot;应收现金总额&quot;在无法找零时圆到最近 5 分。&quot;The United States Treasury has stopped minting the penny&quot;（SST 页面原文）后，这条规则从可选变成了收银系统的必要行为。工程上要把&quot;税额&quot;与&quot;现金应收额&quot;存成两个字段，绝不能用后者覆盖前者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"幂等固化与可重算-把不确定性关进版本号\">幂等固化与可重算：把不确定性关进版本号</h2><p>税务计算的幂等不是&quot;缓存结果&quot;这么简单，因为税率会变、边界会变、地址解析规则也会变。正确的契约是：<strong>计算键（calculation key）捕捉所有输入，结果可无条件复算</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>key</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mtext>addr</mtext><mtext>norm</mtext></msub><mo>∥</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>rate</mtext></msub><mo>∥</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>boundary</mtext></msub><mo>∥</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∥</mo><mtext>roundMode</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{key} = H\\big(\\text{addr}_{\\text{norm}} \\parallel V_{\\text{rate}} \\parallel V_{\\text{boundary}} \\parallel B \\parallel \\text{roundMode}\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">key</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">addr</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">norm</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rate</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">boundary</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">roundMode</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>rate</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{rate}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rate</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>boundary</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{boundary}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">boundary</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>边界数据版本</strong>——税务引擎每月甚至每周更新一次辖区边界与税率（Avalara、Vertex 均按月发布内容版本），一条 2026-03 的订单若在 2026-09 重算，必须仍取 2026-03 时点的边界版本，否则重算值与原值不符，对账永远平不了。</p>\n<p>由此导出三条工程规则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>订单快照存原始地址与规范化结果两者</strong>。只存规范化结果会让&quot;当时为什么解析成这个辖区&quot;在边界更新后不可复现。</li>\n<li><strong>计算记录存 key 与全部输入</strong>，而不只存输出税额。退款/补算时按 key 复算，命中则直接返回，不重查实时税率。</li>\n<li><strong>边界版本随计算一起冻结</strong>。申报与对账读取的是冻结版本，实时税率只用于新订单。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>退款的幂等更微妙：VAT 侧退款按发生时点冲减基数（VAT 指令第 90 条），而 1099-K 侧退款<strong>不冲减</strong> Box 1a、只从笔数中剔除——同一次退款在两条管线上产生不同的调整量，因此 key 里还要带<strong>计算目的</strong>（<code>purpose=vat | 1099k</code>），否则两条管线会命中同一个缓存条目而互相污染。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>税务引擎的可靠性不来自算法复杂度，而来自把每个非确定源都变成显式输入：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>地址先于税率</strong>：CASS/DPV 分级解析，ZIP 内不唯一时按最高税率兜底并记录假设；境外地址按国家格式契约校验。</li>\n<li><strong>来源规则决定用哪个辖区</strong>：美国多数州目的地来源，欧盟 B2C 默认运输终止地，€10,000 门槛下可回落供应商国；市场代扣只转移申报义务，不改变落点。</li>\n<li><strong>多辖区列表不可压扁</strong>：州/县/市/特别区（以及科罗拉多自治市）必须分别判定，否则无法拆分申报。</li>\n<li><strong>舍入用十进制、分模式显式声明</strong>：SST 第三位小数进位规则一视同仁，但行级/单据级下放到各州；现金五分圆整只改应收额、不改税额。</li>\n<li><strong>幂等靠计算键而非缓存</strong>：key 捕捉地址、边界版本、基数、舍入模式与计算目的，重算按 key 复现，退款在 VAT 与 1099-K 两条管线上走不同调整。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>同章节的 <a href=\"withholding-base-rate-determination\">代扣基数与税率确定</a> 定义了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 的口径，本文的管线负责把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B \\times r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 变成可复现、可审计、可幂等的税额；两者共同构成平台代扣计算的完整输入契约。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"税务引擎计算管线：地址校验、管辖来源与舍入幂等","id":"税务引擎计算管线-地址校验-管辖来源与舍入幂等"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：管线的六个阶段与两个不变量","id":"核心概念-管线的六个阶段与两个不变量"},{"level":2,"text":"地址校验：CASS、DPV 与\"不可解析\"的降级","id":"地址校验-cass-dpv-与-不可解析-的降级"},{"level":2,"text":"管辖来源：目的地、起始地与市场代扣的三角","id":"管辖来源-目的地-起始地与市场代扣的三角"},{"level":2,"text":"舍入：行级还是单据级，以及为什么它不是细节","id":"舍入-行级还是单据级-以及为什么它不是细节"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等固化与可重算：把不确定性关进版本号","id":"幂等固化与可重算-把不确定性关进版本号"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"代扣基数与税率确定：成交额、佣金、运费与市场税","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-tax-withholding-seller-1099-reporting/withholding-calculation-collection/withholding-base-rate-determination"},"next":{"title":"代扣收取、卖家余额抵扣、退款冲销与平台汇缴","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-tax-withholding-seller-1099-reporting/withholding-calculation-collection/withholding-collection-settlement-remittance"}}